      "body": "ক) $\\overrightarrow{AC} = \\overrightarrow{AD} + \\overrightarrow{DC} = \\overrightarrow{AD} + \\overrightarrow{AB}$\nআবার, $\\overrightarrow{AB} + \\overrightarrow{BD} = \\overrightarrow{AD}$ বা, $\\overrightarrow{BD} = \\overrightarrow{AD} - \\overrightarrow{AB}$",
