      "kind": "text",
      "section": "সমাধান:",
      "caption": null,
      "body": "খ) যেহেতু সমান্তরিকের কর্ণদ্বয় পরস্পর সমদ্বিখণ্ডিত হয়,\n$\\overrightarrow{AB} = \\overrightarrow{AO} + \\overrightarrow{OB} = \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{AC} + \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{DB} = \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{AC} - \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{BD}$\nএবং $\\overrightarrow{AD} = \\overrightarrow{AO} + \\overrightarrow{OD} = \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{AC} + \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{BD}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\overrightarrow{AB} = \\overrightarrow{AO} + \\overrightarrow{OB} = \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{AC} + \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{DB} = \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{AC} - \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{BD}",
        "\\overrightarrow{AD} = \\overrightarrow{AO} + \\overrightarrow{OD} = \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{AC} + \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{BD}"
      ],
