      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.10-p026",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": "সমাধান:",
      "caption": null,
      "body": "ভেক্টর বিয়োগের ত্রিভুজবিধি অনুসারে, $\\overrightarrow{AE} - \\overrightarrow{AD} = \\overrightarrow{DE}$ (1)\nএবং $\\overrightarrow{AC} - \\overrightarrow{AB} = \\overrightarrow{BC}$\nকিন্তু $\\overrightarrow{AC} = 2\\overrightarrow{AE}$, $\\overrightarrow{AB} = 2\\overrightarrow{AD}$ [$\\because D, E$ বিন্দু যথাক্রমে $AB$ ও $AC$ এর মধ্যবিন্দু]\n$\\therefore \\overrightarrow{AC} - \\overrightarrow{AB} = \\overrightarrow{BC}$ থেকে পাই\n$2\\overrightarrow{AE} - 2\\overrightarrow{AD} = \\overrightarrow{BC}$, অর্থাৎ $2(\\overrightarrow{AE} - \\overrightarrow{AD}) = \\overrightarrow{BC}$\n$\\therefore 2\\overrightarrow{DE} = \\overrightarrow{BC}$ [(1) হতে]\n$\\therefore \\overrightarrow{DE} = \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{BC}$\nএবং $|\\overrightarrow{DE}| = \\frac{1}{2}|\\overrightarrow{BC}|$ বা $DE = \\frac{1}{2}BC$ সুতরাং $\\overrightarrow{DE}$ ও $\\overrightarrow{BC}$ ভেক্টরদ্বয়ের ধারক রেখা একই বা সমান্তরাল। কিন্তু এখানে ধারক রেখা এক নয়। সুতরাং $\\overrightarrow{DE}$ ও $\\overrightarrow{BC}$ ভেক্টরদ্বয়ের ধারক রেখাদ্বয় অর্থাৎ $DE$ এবং $BC$ সমান্তরাল।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\overrightarrow{AE} - \\overrightarrow{AD} = \\overrightarrow{DE}",
        "\\overrightarrow{AC} - \\overrightarrow{AB} = \\overrightarrow{BC}",
        "\\overrightarrow{AC} = 2\\overrightarrow{AE}",
        "\\overrightarrow{AB} = 2\\overrightarrow{AD}",
        "\\because D, E",
        "AB",
        "AC",
        "\\therefore \\overrightarrow{AC} - \\overrightarrow{AB} = \\overrightarrow{BC}",
        "2\\overrightarrow{AE} - 2\\overrightarrow{AD} = \\overrightarrow{BC}",
        "2(\\overrightarrow{AE} - \\overrightarrow{AD}) = \\overrightarrow{BC}",
        "\\therefore 2\\overrightarrow{DE} = \\overrightarrow{BC}",
        "\\therefore \\overrightarrow{DE} = \\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{BC}",
        "|\\overrightarrow{DE}| = \\frac{1}{2}|\\overrightarrow{BC}|",
        "DE = \\frac{1}{2}BC",
        "\\overrightarrow{DE}",
        "\\overrightarrow{BC}",
        "\\overrightarrow{DE}",
        "\\overrightarrow{BC}",
        "DE",
        "BC"
      ],
